# Everything in this repo runs inside Linux containers or on the Pi, so check
# files out with LF endings on every machine -- including Windows, where Git
# otherwise converts to CRLF on checkout (core.autocrlf=true is the default).
#
# A CRLF entrypoint.sh breaks the Docker build silently: the shebang becomes
# "#!/bin/bash\r" and the container dies with "no such file or directory".
* text=auto eol=lf

*.xz binary
